  <item>
    <title>10 你还期待过年吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/698b26c3a22480add6881e11</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">698b26c3a22480add6881e11</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 10 Feb 2026 12:44:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>小时候，过年是最期待的一天，可以穿新衣服，可以收红包钱；但现在，好想年味儿越来越没有了，也不像小时候一样期待过年了。又快过年了，让我们来聊聊过年。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>Timeline</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:00:40</a> &nbsp;记忆里的年味是烟花、自制蜡烛、烤红薯、擦擦炮</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">00:03:00</a> &nbsp;女性儿时伙伴长大后就像蒲公英一样散落在各处，即使过年也难得一见</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">00:06:30</a> &nbsp;如今过年已经被催婚催孕的压力压到变形</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="500">00:08:20</a> &nbsp;年味儿为什么越来越淡了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">00:10:00</a> &nbsp;女性越来越不愿意委屈自己操持年夜饭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">00:15:50</a> &nbsp;年货、年夜饭菜品大推荐！</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们推荐的年货零食：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhpKmGHRLTpYx5PXunuuntItDdKT.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>糖醋排骨（电饭煲版）</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>食材准备：肋排（一盘）、葱姜、料酒、生抽、老抽、耗油、冰糖、味精、白芝麻、苹果醋</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>步骤：    </span><ul><span>      </span><li><span>焯水（新鲜的不用焯水，泡冷水30min）：葱打结，姜3-5片，料酒两勺，</span><strong><span>冷水</span></strong><span>下锅，煮开后撇去浮沫</span></li><span>      </span><li><span>焯水的同时调料汁：老抽1勺、冰糖2勺、生抽3勺、苹果醋大半碗（或醋4勺）、味精1勺、耗油1勺（甩）</span></li><span>      </span><li><span>捞出排骨放电饭锅里，把料汁倒进去搅拌均匀，再放3片姜，按煮饭键（30min），中途可以开盖看状态</span></li><span>      </span><li><span>出锅装盘，撒上白芝麻</span></li><span>    </span></ul><span>  </span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Tips：新鲜的排骨不需要焯水，冷水泡30min即可；食材也可以换成鸡翅</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>这一期是我们第一次线下录的，很抱歉可能很多喷麦的情况，请大家海涵！我们仨在公园吸氧，封面是那天美丽的夕阳，分享给你，祝你新年快乐~</span></blockquote>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65911b891af2dd934712c2bb/lpVlt4aqyDpQYsMEH9jnZ9mSL7qK.m4a" length="24963642" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:25:43</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fio6yXFJiw0R8MYlqjgTuznYZJNJ.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>09 读书分享：《你当像鸟飞往你的山》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/686cd64793fd2d72b81fe7f4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">686cd64793fd2d72b81fe7f4</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 08 Jul 2025 08:31:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天要给大家介绍一本书——《你当像鸟飞往你的山》（Educated）——这个诗意的书名背后，藏着一道鲜血淋漓的伤疤。塔拉·韦斯特弗的自传像一柄生锈的凿子，缓慢而残酷地撬开现代文明社会的幻觉：</span><strong><span>当一个人连“世界是圆的”都需要用半生去验证时，教育的意义究竟是什么？</span></strong></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>Timeline</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a> 巴克峰上的“末日信仰”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="175">02:55</a> 28分与马桶里的倒影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="348">05:48</a> 大学里的“异星球生存指南”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="397">06:37</a> 暴力的阴影与自我欺骗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">08:30</a> 逃离的代价</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="598">09:58</a> 剑桥的悖论：赞美与羞耻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="680">11:20</a> 背叛的轮回：家人与刀片</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> 这福气给你要不要啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="877">14:37</a> 飞鸟与群山</span></p><span></span><p><span>文字版可在这里查看：<a data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/UJFfLnFwrKJGGTNb7tOyvQ" href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/UJFfLnFwrKJGGTNb7tOyvQ">mp.weixin.qq.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢你的收听~</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65911b891af2dd934712c2bb/ljAAaWna9gGDnw12cPpSs8NJRtZ-.m4a" length="15100992" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:15:33</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl0Z_KtsI_6ZOxemEU4Ke3TKjZcg.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
