  <item>
    <title>07 读书分享：《房思琪的初恋乐园》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/675a3c2e17cd5416ad66cbee</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">675a3c2e17cd5416ad66cbee</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 12 Dec 2024 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《房思琪的初恋乐园》对性侵问题的深刻揭示和对受害者心理的细腻描绘，它不仅仅是一个悲剧故事，更是一个对性教育和法律制度的控诉。作者林奕含在出书后不久就在家自缢了，她说：“这只是一本小说，你们都说看不下去，而那是我的人生，你们却要我活下去。”今天让我们一起来读这本向死而生的文学绝唱，百万读者强烈共鸣的现象级小说。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>Timeline</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="154">02:34</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;房思琪与恶魔的初见</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="226">03:46</a> 干杯！为缺少性教育的少女们干杯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="365">06:05</a> 那年教师节，是从思琪人生的所有黑夜中舀出最黑的一个夜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="640">10:40</a>李国华的第一个猎物——饼干</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="787">13:07</a> 社会对性的禁忌，把受害者赶回施暴者身边</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1025">17:05</a> 伥鬼蔡良把晓奇送入魔爪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1120">18:40</a> 时间管理大师李国华想方设法“处理”郭晓奇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1290">21:30</a> 出差也要去红灯区，要最年轻的，因为他们会老，但少女不会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1410">23:30</a> 思琪解离，看着肉体在受苦，灵魂也跟着流泪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1539">25:39</a> 对于婚外情，男性只要说是女性的勾引或是为了“买包”就能把所有责任推给女性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1706">28:26</a> &nbsp;网络言论同李国华一样，一遍遍杀死郭晓奇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1841">30:41</a> 怡婷和伊纹给思琪的信成了思琪唯一的光</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1970">32:50</a> &nbsp;这一次灵魂不回来了，她自由了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a> 因为爱，怡婷愿意千千万万遍体会思琪的痛苦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2200">36:40</a> 忍耐不是美德，愤怒才是！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>片尾曲</span></strong><span>：负重一万斤长大 &nbsp;-太一</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>感谢收听~</span></blockquote>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lq8kaEcJtvCsGDShp64XL65hyC81.m4a" length="39886972" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:41:06</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkHI017fUsdn8MZce-c0xLRYeYFv.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>06「看见她」女性如何被忽视</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6729901633c798676f8589d4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6729901633c798676f8589d4</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 05 Nov 2024 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;世界仿佛是一个巨大的爱丁堡，即使是在人类进化的图片上，编年史家都几乎没有为女性在人类演化中扮演的角色留下什么空间。女性在办公室里瑟瑟发抖，因为空调温度是按男性的体温标准设定；或者伸手够货架顶端十分费劲，因为货架是按男性的身高标准设计。这让人恼火吗？当然了！这是不是不公平？毫无疑问。</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;这一期是【看见她】系列的第一期，今天我们邀请了朋友邹邹一起连线，从不合理的设计入手，来浅聊一下女性是怎样从方方面面被忽视的。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>Timeline</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3065507089&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1208629493#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3065507089&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1208629493#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="72">01:12</a></span></a><span> 女性服装上消失的口袋</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3065507089&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1208629493#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3065507089&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1208629493#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="415">06:55</a></span></a><span> 一辈子离不开难穿的内衣和内裤</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3065507089&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1208629493#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3065507089&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1208629493#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1074">17:54</a></span></a><span> 细数卫生巾七宗罪</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3065507089&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1208629493#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3065507089&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1208629493#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1722">28:42</a></span></a><span> 你想象不到女性上厕所能有多狼狈</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3065507089&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1208629493#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3065507089&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1208629493#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2058">34:18</a></span></a><span> “母婴室”应该叫“婴儿护理室”</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3065507089&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1208629493#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3065507089&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1208629493#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2108">35:08</a></span></a><span> 丢掉“好媳妇”拖把，拒绝社会规训</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3065507089&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1208629493#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3065507089&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1208629493#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2186">36:26</a></span></a><span> 把女性圈定在厨房的设计</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3065507089&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1208629493#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3065507089&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1208629493#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2605">43:25</a></span></a><span> 透明楼梯想看见什么</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3065507089&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1208629493#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3065507089&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1208629493#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2723">45:23</a></span></a><span> 汽车的不合理设计导致女性面临更多危险</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3065507089&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1208629493#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3065507089&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1208629493#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2907">48:27</a></span></a><span> 女性游泳月卡就该是五周</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3065507089&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1208629493#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3065507089&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1208629493#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3139">52:19</a></span></a><span> 怎么不禁止男教师在办公室抽烟?</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3065507089&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1208629493#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3065507089&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1208629493#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3410">56:50</a></span></a><span> 家庭教育中被忽视被指责的妈， 和坐享教育成果的爸</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>相关书籍&amp;影视&amp;文章</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>书籍：《看不见的女性》[英] 卡罗琳·克里亚多·佩雷斯</span></p><span></span><p><span>视频：博主【蜡笔油】对日本卫生间的吐槽视频指路</span></p><span></span><p><span>健身博主：周六野、安娜、帕梅拉、费教练</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：Porto girl - 그래쓰</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>欢迎大家分享发现的不合理设计，可以从日常生活、职场、规则制度等方面观察。从女性角度出发，你觉得应该怎么设计比较好？</span></strong></blockquote>]]></description>
