    <pubDate>Thu, 19 Sep 2024 10:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>最近阿长装修了新房，我们迫不及待做一期关于装修的话题~这期我们将用访谈的形式，来聊聊装修和一些生活技巧，希望可以对你有些帮助和启发！</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们总共用上、中、下三期给大家详细介绍，本期主要内容是介绍装修的整体过程以及省钱小攻略</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>Timeline</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="36">00:36</a> 整体情况：户型、施工时间、装修流程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a> 城管罚单竟贴到家里！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="303">05:03</a> 装修格局改变需要了解当地政策</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="468">07:48</a> 精装房看似省事，实则浪费资源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="670">11:10</a> 装修各项费用占比介绍：最费钱的部分居然是它</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">15:30</a> 会用PPT就能自己做设计！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 记笔记！设计时必须了解的标准尺寸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1338">22:18</a> 如何和设计师有效沟通自己喜欢的装修风格？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> 简单的安装自己动手有趣又省钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2024">33:44</a> 材料怎么买更省钱？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2137">35:37</a> 不做大冤种！线上购物也可以讲价</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2304">38:24</a> 冷知识！客服不会告诉你的保价活动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2450">40:50</a> 做好资源回收也能省下一笔！</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>相关书籍</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>《小家大变局》 &nbsp;逯薇</span></p><span></span><p><span>《小家越住越大》系列 &nbsp;逯薇</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>推荐APP</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>家居类：好好住、一兜糖、小红书</span></p><span></span><p><span>设计类：酷家乐、PPT</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>家居博主</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>生活小巧思、租房改造：蒜蒜了叭</span></p><span></span><p><span>户型优化改造（图纸讲解）：B站刀文哥</span></p><span></span><p><span>柜子定制、尺寸详解：真真真ing、大冤种的收纳大法、猫力</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>希望对你有帮助！</span></strong></blockquote>]]></description>
