  <item>
    <title>04 死亡不是失去生命，而是走出时间</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66c202e433591c27bef8fd36</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66c202e433591c27bef8fd36</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 18 Aug 2024 14:19:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>对于死亡的话题，我们向来都是避而不谈，因为生命的消亡，带给我们的更多是恐惧和悲伤。但是逃避并不代表这不存在。生命对任何人都是公平的，不论你的财富、地位如何，最终都会走向死亡。所以，今天我们想和大家聊一聊死亡的意义。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>Timeline</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="45">00:45</a> 热爱生活的奶奶自愿结束这一生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="198">03:18</a> 那棵桃树也在告别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="373">06:13</a> 人生最后的体面是上厕所</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">08:50</a> 我仍深刻记得与外公的最后一面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="636">10:36</a> 支开所有人，独自面对死亡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="755">12:35</a> 爷爷的离开是一场春游</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="843">14:03</a> 灵魂超度：你没听过的葬礼习俗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a> 传统葬礼习俗下的女性：毫无血缘关系的姑姑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1234">20:34</a> 葬礼后的“卡拉OK”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1390">23:10</a> 你愿意树葬，土葬，抑或变成一颗钻石？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1513">25:13</a> 亲人的离去是此生漫长的潮湿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1867">31:07</a> 如果人生终会死，现在和未来又有什么不同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1988">33:08</a> 天天把死挂嘴边，但体检报告不能有一点问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2121">35:21</a> 安乐死与延命治疗的选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2462">41:02</a> 在安宁医院中向世界告别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2765">46:05</a> 有人在盯着你的器官——器官捐赠的黑暗面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2882">48:02</a> 遗愿清单让你的动力超级加倍！</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>相关书籍&amp;影视&amp;文章</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>书籍《最好的告别》 [美] &nbsp;阿图·葛文德</span></p><span></span><p><span>书籍《活好：我就这样活到了105岁》[日] 日野原重明</span></p><span></span><p><span>书籍《在熟悉家中向世界道别》[日] 上野千鹤子</span></p><span></span><p><span>电视剧《三悦有了新工作》</span></p><span></span><p><span>电影《寻梦环游记》</span></p><span></span><p><span>电影《心灵奇旅》</span></p><span></span><p><span>电影《遗愿清单》</span></p><span></span><p><span>纪录片《如何死亡：西蒙的抉择》</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>希望大家都勇敢而热烈的活着！</span></strong></blockquote>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvpMKBi-G60wfLCyreCj4ZwsFSXN.m4a" length="97031795" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:50:15</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh1oSF0F1_J7HKX9eqAsKo-5aJVA.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>03 做个好梦，睡个好觉</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6682bc14077b88831b85ca9b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6682bc14077b88831b85ca9b</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 02 Jul 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在梦里，我们可以拯救世界，可以插上翅膀，可以超越生死，甚至无视牛顿和爱因斯坦。这明显的BUG在梦中也很合理，因此你的小伙伴总能在你幻想中五百万时，友善的提醒你“洗洗睡吧，梦里什么都有”，那么今天就让我们分享下梦里都有什么吧！</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>Timeline</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:40</a> 梦中的无力感解决办法竟然是离职</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="163">02:43</a> 一个惊险刺激的枪战梦，最后竟以滴滴打车收尾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> 我和朋友被残疾人追杀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="604">10:04</a> 什么？你也有“鬼压床”的经历！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="666">11:06</a> 又是这个楼梯？我已经爬过4次了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="822">13:42</a> 一个小孩在我怀里自燃了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1045">17:25</a> 我竟然每个梦里都在找鞋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1271">21:11</a> 梦是刻在基因里的吗？也许是原始人给你的来信</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1530">25:30</a> 什么是人？欲望满身——梦是“本我”愿望的达成</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1877">31:17</a> 解读梦，也是在解读自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2063">34:23</a> 快做笔记！啊圆给大家科普梦里常见的象征物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">43:00</a> 经常做不好的梦可能提示你该看医生了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2633">43:53</a> 做梦是为了促进自我认识和自我接纳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2709">45:09</a> 梦是存在脑袋里同一个磁盘吗？——记梦的方法分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2930">48:50</a> 良好（并不一定）的睡眠习惯分享</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>相关书籍&amp;影视&amp;文章</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>书籍《释梦》朱建军</span></p><span></span><p><span>书籍《梦的解析》[奥] 西格蒙德·弗洛伊德</span></p><span></span><p><span>电影《盗梦空间》</span></p><span></span><p><span>UP主青蛙刀圣1993的视频：</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Jo4y187oL/?share_source=copy_web&amp;vd_source=8f08ba023c2bd58e36e5f9967bea69b5" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Jo4y187oL/?share_source=copy_web&amp;vd_source=8f08ba023c2bd58e36e5f9967bea69b5"><span>潜意识的科普</span></a></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>祝大家睡个好觉，做个好梦</span></strong></blockquote>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/llM1_BI5NbOpCzmj7nE9XYEBR5q_.m4a" length="55176263" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:56:51</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtyesE6578x-kXcubtWhXrpaJfKF.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>02 打破刻板印象，我本不该被定义</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/663459fd03bcdd73a93d315b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">663459fd03bcdd73a93d315b</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 03 May 2024 03:28:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们生来带着有色眼镜，同时又遭受着各种偏见。刻板印象无处不在，它成为了我们的标志，同时也可能成为我们的负担。有时使人努力过度，有时又扼杀了自我本性。本期我们将从对地域、职业、性别这3个方面聊聊我们身边存在的刻板印象，粗浅地剖析造成这些现象的原因。探讨我们的社会意识，是如何被构置与强化的？</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>Timeline</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>关于地域的刻板印象</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="62">01:02</a> 福建人的吃辣属性与标准普通话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="340">05:40</a> 听东北唠嗑与瓜子的渊源，品重庆火锅的香与辣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> 人杰地灵的贵州，是贫困还是富裕？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="943">15:43</a> “IP正确”？——IP无法概述的复杂人生轨迹</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>对职业 / 专业的刻板印象</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">19:30</a> 互联网从业者手中的“互联网”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1533">25:33</a> 工程行业中甲乙双方降本增效的拔河比赛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1725">28:45</a> 从“二本”学生出发，探讨唯学历论下的能力与公平</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2423">40:23</a> 工程单位中的 “男性优先”原则</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2570">42:50</a> 男本位思想下的 “女”院士</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2722">45:22</a> AI宁愿相信男的来月经也不愿相信女的当总裁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2835">47:15</a> 追星道路上，被宣扬的极端分子与被掩埋的正常人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3015">50:15</a> 一针分享染浅发被骚扰经历</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>对男女性别的刻板印象</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3143">52:23</a> 女性从玩具选择开始被规训的一生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3272">54:32</a> “独立女性”新画像，是平权的号召还是新的枷锁？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3640">1:00:40</a> 随处可见的男强女弱二元性别体系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3790">1:03:10</a> 电视剧中的极致“颜值正义”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3963">1:06:03</a> 从出生就被塑造的性别色彩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4160">1:09:20</a> 男生比女生聪明？简直在胡说八道！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4645">1:17:25</a> 无法避免的刻板印象，我们需要不断提高自我认识</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>【相关书籍&amp;影视&amp;文章】</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>书籍 《我的二本学生》黄灯</span></p><span></span><p><span>书籍 《刻板印象：我们为何歧视与被歧视》 [美] 克劳德·M.斯蒂尔</span></p><span></span><p><span>电影《芭比》</span></p><span></span><p><span>电视剧 《战斗民族养成记》</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号文章： </span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/MDZNaxHtHdOi9K04pYTTaQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/MDZNaxHtHdOi9K04pYTTaQ"><span>《蓝色是男孩的颜色 丨 关于颜色与性别文化的秘密》</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>辩论赛： </span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Xk4y1M74f/?spm_id_from=333.999.0.0&amp;vd_source=1d5f273f30f0b948e800a6b4832b6458" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Xk4y1M74f/?spm_id_from=333.999.0.0&amp;vd_source=1d5f273f30f0b948e800a6b4832b6458"><span>《独立女性是平权的号召还是新的枷锁》</span></a></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>祝大家假期愉快！</span></strong></blockquote>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/liEZBIB_w1YeI16VzpSRSbxcgUQ9.m4a" length="115272822" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:20:27</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo2PDz79e0DC0DYnr2QZcCliuNKJ.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>01 2023皆为序章，2024勇敢出发</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65928d6fbf3589e894845264</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65928d6fbf3589e894845264</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 2024 10:01:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是我们的第一期，录这个播客我们只策划了3个小时，一拍即合！泛泛三千不如知己一二，希望我们能在这达到灵魂共振。恰好在跨年夜录制，我们这一期会分享2023的经验与收获，并且对2024年做一个整体的规划。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>Timeline</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a> 年仅26的阿长竟然已经戴上了假牙——阿长的种牙经验分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="965">16:05</a> 阿圆从跑步中重新找回掌控人生的感觉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1265">21:05</a> 阿秀投稿：旅行中认识到自己的渺小，更加珍惜陪伴父母的时光</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1723">28:43</a> 艺真勇敢走出舒适圈，裸辞后来了一场说走就走的旅行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a> 南方人首次体验东北洗浴文化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">44:00</a> 艺真强烈安利青旅，捡不同的饭搭子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2858">47:38</a> 阿长强烈推荐所有人都去读《小狗钱钱》！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3207">53:27</a> 阿圆推荐日剧《风平浪静的闲暇》，开始真正对 Ta人感兴趣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3473">57:53</a> 大家的心愿清单分享，从健康、学习、存钱到旅行</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>祝大家新年快乐！</span></strong></blockquote>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltT_KVZ_UYnZ2HcGC_MxEYFFKEnr.m4a" length="155638720" type="audio/mp4"/>
